     "de": "Wie heißt du? – Ich heiße Sāmī.",
     "gloss": "مَا اسْم·ُك؟ – اِسْم·ِي سَامِي. | was Name·dein? – Name·mein Sāmī.",
     "umschrift": "mā smuk? – ismī Sāmī.",
